+/// Like [test]; the declared signature mirrors [test] so existing bodies
+/// drop in unchanged. Every test in this file wraps its body in
+/// [guardedBody], which prints a per-test log marker quoting the test's
+/// description so every test is attributable in the captured run log on
+/// every run.
